' Modern flat skinparam — shared across all C4 diagrams in this project.
' Palette: teal (Person) / indigo (Container) / violet (ContainerDb) / slate (Boundary).
' Portable across GitHub light + dark themes; contrast ratio >= 4.5:1 with white text.

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 4
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.0
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 1.0
skinparam wrapWidth 160

' Compact C4 element sizing — smaller fonts + tighter wrap cap so boxes
' don't tower. C4-PlantUML rectangles are minimum-sized to fit text, so
' wrapWidth is the load-bearing knob for width; font size shrinks height.

UpdateElementStyle("person",        $fontColor="#FFFFFF", $bgColor="#0F766E", $borderColor="#134E4A")
UpdateElementStyle("container",     $fontColor="#FFFFFF", $bgColor="#2563EB", $borderColor="#1E3A8A")
UpdateElementStyle("system",        $fontColor="#FFFFFF", $bgColor="#2563EB", $borderColor="#1E3A8A")
UpdateBoundaryStyle($bgColor="#F1F5F9", $borderColor="#94A3B8", $fontColor="#1E293B")

' ContainerDb()/ContainerQueue() render the plain `container` style tag — there is
' NO distinct container_db/container_queue tag in C4-PlantUML v2.13.0, so
' UpdateElementStyle("container_db"/"container_queue", …) silently no-ops (verified
' by pixel-sampling: the DB box rendered indigo, not violet). Define the
' datastore/queue colours as explicit tags and attach them via $tags= at each
' ContainerDb()/ContainerQueue() call site instead. System_Ext is unused in every
' diagram, so no external style is defined (it would be `external_system`, not
' `system_ext`, if ever added — grey is C4's conventional external colour).
AddElementTag("datastore", $fontColor="#FFFFFF", $bgColor="#7C3AED", $borderColor="#4C1D95")
AddElementTag("queue",     $fontColor="#FFFFFF", $bgColor="#DB2777", $borderColor="#831843")
